Nette Security
**************

.[perex]
The `nette/security` package is in charge of [authenticating users |authentication], [access control |authorization] including [rules by roles and parts of the site |acl], and [password hashing |passwords].

Installation:

```shell
composer require nette/security
```

{{maintitle: Nette Security: Login, Permissions and Password Hashing}}
{{description: User accounts done safely in PHP: log users in and out, check their permissions by roles or with an ACL, and store their passwords as secure hashes.}}
